creation of SHA256 and Md5 

1) Create Zip file of code 
2) using command of below make SHA256 and MD5
REM SHA256
certutil -hashfile yourfile.zip SHA256

REM MD5
certutil -hashfile yourfile.zip MD5

REM SHA256 for APK
certutil -hashfile yourfile.apk SHA256

REM MD5 for APK
certutil -hashfile yourfile.apk MD5


3) Make Apk file and use same above commands for MD5 and SHA256
